{"id":"n38031-1-8","stage":3,"title":"끌어안다 · 搂","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38031-1-8-1","ko":"유민이는 자?","zh":"裕敏睡了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이는","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"유민이는","audio":"/audio/727cddb4c6676098ab15.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민이는","audio":"/audio/727cddb4c6676098ab15.mp3"}},{"text":"자?","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자","audio":"/audio/34f404d9d0a79aa558ba.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]}],"audio":"/audio/17b1ed1fb163dc2e1959.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38031-1-8-2","ko":"응. 자장가를 불러 줬더니 인형을 끌어안고 잠이 들었어.","zh":"嗯。给她唱了摇篮曲后，她就抱着玩偶睡着了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"자장가를","meaning":"摇篮曲，催眠曲","explanation":"자장가：摇篮曲，催眠曲；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자장가","audio":"/audio/bb330d39b53c700610c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73160","senseId":"1","lemma":"자장가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자장가를","audio":"/audio/0d0feff9c31b4f4b52b0.mp3"}},{"text":"불러","meaning":"唱","explanation":"부르다：唱；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"4","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불러","audio":"/audio/a0c799f40c326e493709.mp3"}},{"text":"줬더니","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줬더니","audio":"/audio/9a2183c1a587f605b3f4.mp3"}},{"text":"인형을","meaning":"娃娃","explanation":"인형：娃娃；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"인형","audio":"/audio/0107283a24c66d348a28.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70776","senseId":"1","lemma":"인형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인형을","audio":"/audio/1e8e760c259f88694a86.mp3"}},{"text":"끌어안고","meaning":"搂，搂抱","explanation":"끌어안다：搂，搂抱；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끌어안다","audio":"/audio/b1c0bec9b847e18b7212.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38031","senseId":"1","lemma":"끌어안다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끌어안고","audio":"/audio/b590253cc6dd37147f4b.mp3"}},{"text":"잠이","meaning":"觉，睡眠","explanation":"잠：觉，睡眠；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"잠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70078","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠이","audio":"/audio/17d08bab4f403526dabd.mp3"}},{"text":"들었어.","meaning":"进入，入睡","explanation":"들다：进入，入睡；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"5","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들었어","audio":"/audio/212b440366b02768c97f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"bb330d39b53c7006","term":"자장가","zh":"摇篮曲，催眠曲","audio":"/audio